#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:198
msgid ""
"``ioctl(file, HSMP_IOCTL_GET_TELEMETRY_DATA, struct hsmp_telemetry_data "
"*req)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:199
msgid ""
"Atomically fetch the firmware metric (telemetry) table for a socket. The "
"ioctl copies the table in one shot, so unlike the metrics_bin sysfs path it "
"cannot return a torn snapshot and is not bounded by PAGE_SIZE.  Required for "
"HSMP protocol version 7+ (e.g. Family 1Ah Model 50h-5Fh, whose table is ~13 "
"KB).  Argument::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:212
msgid ""
"``size`` must be non-zero and no larger than the table size firmware reports "
"for that socket; a larger value is rejected with ``-EINVAL`` rather than "
"short-written, and a smaller one returns the leading ``size`` bytes of the "
"snapshot.  A non-zero ``reserved`` is also rejected with ``-EINVAL``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:218
msgid ""
"The table layout depends on the protocol version, which userspace reads from "
"the ``protocol_version`` sysfs attribute.  On version 6 the table is "
"``struct hsmp_metric_table``, so callers pass ``sizeof(struct "
"hsmp_metric_table)``.  Later version metrics table layout is documented in "
"the Public PPR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:224
msgid ""
"The Family 1Ah client models carry their own telemetry table instead, "
"described in `Family 1Ah client telemetry table`_ below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:227
msgid ""
"The ioctl would return a non-zero on failure; you can read errno to see what "
"happened. The transaction returns 0 on success."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:231
msgid "Family 1Ah client telemetry table"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the Family 1Ah client models, ``HSMP_CLIENT_GET_METRICS_TABLE`` (05h) "
"returns the Ryzen Master SMC telemetry table, table version 5 as reported by "
"``HSMP_CLIENT_GET_METRICS_TABLE_VER`` (04h). This is the Telemetry Table RM "
"layout, defined as ``struct hsmp_telemetry_table_rm`` in amd_hsmp.h. The "
"driver copies the table out without interpreting it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:238
msgid ""
"See the telemetry table chapter of the AMD Public PPR for the model in use "
"for the units and encodings of its fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../arch/x86/amd_hsmp.rst:241
msgid ""
"More details on the interface and message definitions can be found in "
"chapter \"7 Host System Management Port (HSMP)\" of the respective family/"
"model PPR eg: https://docs.amd.com/v/u/en-US/55898_B1_pub_0_50"
msgstr ""

